OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA dry and brighter start to
OL,6,FFriday with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,7,FCloud will turn the sunshine hazy
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon, with sunnier
OL,9,Fweather returning later. Fresher than
OL,10,Frecent days.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThough
OL,13,Fremaining a little cooler and fresher,
OL,14,Fthere will be some warm spells of
OL,15,Fsunshine at times, but an isolated
OL,16,Fshower possible. Possibly turning
OL,17,Fwetter on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
